              "section_type": "Item_8"
            },
            "chunk_type": "segment",
            "content": "the Data Center segment, which primarily includes server microprocessors (CPUs), graphics processing units (GPUs), accelerated processing units (APUs), data processing units (DPUs), Field Programmable Gate Arrays (FPGAs), Smart Network Interface Cards (SmartNICs), Artificial Intelligence (AI) accelerators and Adaptive System-on-Chip (SoC) products for data centers",
            "entity_name": "AMD Data Center Segment",
            "entity_type_entity": "RevenueSegment",
            "valid_from": "2024-01-30",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "note": "NOTE 4",
              "section_type": "Item_8"
            },
            "chunk_type": "segment",
            "content": "the Client segment, which primarily includes CPUs, APUs, and chipsets for desktop, notebook and handheld personal computers",
            "entity_name": "AMD Client Segment",
            "entity_type_entity": "RevenueSegment",
            "valid_from": "2024-01-30",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "note": "NOTE 4",
              "section_type": "Item_8"
            },
            "chunk_type": "segment",
            "content": "the Gaming segment, which primarily includes discrete GPUs, and semi-custom SoC products and development services",
            "entity_name": "AMD Gaming Segment",
            "entity_type_entity": "RevenueSegment",
            "valid_from": "2024-01-30",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "note": "NOTE 4",
              "section_type": "Item_8"
            },
            "chunk_type": "segment",
            "content": "the Embedded segment, which primarily includes embedded CPUs, GPUs, APUs, FPGAs, System on Modules (SOMs), and Adaptive SoC products",
            "entity_name": "AMD Embedded Segment",
            "entity_type_entity": "RevenueSegment",
            "valid_from": "2024-01-30",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "note": "NOTE 4",
              "period": "FY2023/FY2022/FY2021",
              "section_type": "Item_8"
            },
            "chunk_type": "segment",
            "content": "The following table provides a summary of net revenue and operating income (loss) by segment for 2023, 2022 and 2021. Net revenue: Data Center$6,496 $6,043 $3,694 Client4,651 6,201 6,887 Gaming6,212 6,805 5,607 Embedded5,321 4,552 246 Total net revenue$22,680 $23,601 $16,434 Operating income (loss): Data Center$1,267 $1,848 $991 Client(46)1,190 2,088 Gaming971 953 934 Embedded2,628 2,252 44 All Other(4,419)(4,979)(409) Total operating income $401 $1,264 $3,648",
            "entity_name": null,
            "entity_type_entity": null,
            "valid_from": "2024-01-30",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_8",
              "statement": "Consolidated Statements of Stockholders Equity"
            },
            "chunk_type": "capital_return",
            "content": "Repurchases of common stock(985)(3,702)(1,762)",
            "entity_name": "AMD FY2023 Common Stock Repurchases",
            "entity_type_entity": "CapitalReturn",
            "valid_from": "2024-01-30",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "note": "NOTE 5",
              "section_type": "Item_8"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "During the year ended December 30, 2023, the Company completed business acquisitions for a total consideration of $134 million that resulted in the recognition of $49 million of identifiable net assets and $85 million of goodwill. The financial results of these acquired businesses, which were not material, were included in the Company's Consolidated Statements of Operations from their respective dates of acquisition under the Data Center, Client and Embedded segments.",
            "entity_name": "AMD FY2023 Business Acquisitions",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": "2024-01-30",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "note": "NOTE 5",
              "section_type": "Item_8"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "On February 14, 2022 (Xilinx Acquisition Date), the Company completed the acquisition of all issued and outstanding shares of Xilinx, a leading provider of adaptive computing solutions, for a total purchase consideration of $48.8 billion ($46.4 billion, net of cash acquired of $2.4 billion). The acquisition of Xilinx expands the Company's product portfolio to include adaptable hardware platforms that enable hardware acceleration and rapid innovation across a variety of technologies. With the acquisition of Xilinx, the Company now offers FPGAs, Adaptive SoC products and ACAP products.",
            "entity_name": "AMD Acquisition of Xilinx",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": "2024-01-30",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "note": "NOTE 5",
              "section_type": "Item_8"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "On May 26, 2022 (Pensando Acquisition Date), the Company completed the acquisition of all issued and outstanding shares of Pensando, a leader in next-generation distributed computing, for a transaction valued at approximately $1.9 billion. The recorded purchase consideration of $1.7 billion is net of deferred cash compensation requiring future services and other customary closing adjustments. The acquisition of Pensando and its leading distributed services platform expands the Company's ability to offer leadership solutions for cloud, enterprise, and edge customers.",
            "entity_name": "AMD Acquisition of Pensando",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": "2024-01-30",
            "valid_until": null
          }
        ],
